  "description": "One cross-platform API for the Salesforce Marketing Cloud SFMC SDK core: awaitable\n      initialization, identity (contact key and attributes) and custom event tracking on Android\n      and iOS from shared code, over the SFMCSDK.Net.Android and SFMCSDK.Net.iOS bindings.\n      Restores on plain target frameworks too, so shared class libraries and unit tests need no\n      platform conditionals.",
